Feature: Destination recommendation using RAG and reviews
    As a user
    I want the system to analyze reviews and recommend desintations
    So that I can quickly find highly rated places

    Scenario: Requesting a destination recommendation
        Given I am logged into the dashboard
        When I ask "Recommend a good pizza place near me"
        Then the system should retrieve reviews from the review database
        And the system should recommend a location based on review sentiment
        And the response should include a Google Maps link to the location

    Scenario: Viewing the recommended location on Google Maps
        Given I am logged into the dashboard
        And the system has recommeneded a destination
        When I clock the Google Maps link
        Then the location should open in Google Maps

    Scenario: Filtering recommenations by category
        Given I am logged into the dashboard
        When I ask "Recommend a highly rated cafe"
        Then the system should analyze cafe reviews
        And the response should include a recommended cafe